<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 5.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 5.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	12.95    1.93</p>
<p> 2   Aust Tour		 9.38    0.80</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 9.23    1.06</p>
<p> 4   Natl Consol	     9.00    1.00</p>
<p> 5   Cudgen R.Z.	     8.93    2.80</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 8.77    1.15</p>
<p> 7   Centro Prop	     8.75    2.20</p>
